silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_13_regression_test_suite_sections_06_probe_sous_totalizing_decomposition_step_2__step_reads__hom_set_observation_read_only;_creates__olog_write_wr a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Reading a Hom-set is an observation operation: it lists existing arrows. Creating an arrow is an authoring operation: it modifies the olog. The sous position has read-access to Hom-sets; it does not have write-access to the olog." .
